## Third-party notices

`vendor/02-vm.cjs` is a bundled build of the 02Engine Scratch VM and its
dependencies, used here only to recompile recovered projects as a verification
oracle. It is not part of this project's own source.

- Full license texts: `vendor/02-vm.LICENSES.txt`
- Provenance and per-package versions: `vendor/02-vm.provenance.json`
- Supplements for packages that omit a license file from their npm tarball:
  `vendor/02-vm.license-supplements.json`

Scratch is a project of the Scratch Foundation, in collaboration with the
Lifelong Kindergarten Group at the MIT Media Lab. This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the Scratch Foundation.
